  "details": "Recently with the release of the new dynamic avatar system, I realized that on the \"contact receivers\" you can't separate your own tags on the from the tags of other users. When I tried to put a button on my hand, I can't stop the button from reacting with my own right hand without stopping it from working with everyone's else right hand. To solve this I had the idea to use two colliders, one for myself and one for other people, but It's a solution that I would like to stop using at some point.",
